वि-√ स्तृ (or -स्तॄ) P. Ā. -स्तृणोति, -स्तृणुते;
 -स्तृणाति, -स्तृणीते (ep. also -स्तरति; ind.p. -स्तीर्य, or -स्तृत्य),
to spread out, scatter, strew (sacrificial grass), R.;
to expand, extend (wings), R.;
to spread abroad, diffuse, divulge, BhP.;
to enlarge or expatiate upon, speak diffusely about (acc.), MBh.; Kāv. (वि-स्तीर्य ind. copiously, at large);
 (with वचनम्) to exchange words, converse with (instr.), ib. :
Pass. -स्तीर्यते or -स्तर्यते (fut. -स्तरिष्यते), to be spread abroad or widely diffused, Mn.; Pañcat.; BhP.;
to be explained, Divyāv. :
Caus. -स्तारयति, to spread, extend, diffuse, display, Mn.; MBh. &c. (-स्तार्य, fully, copiously, at length);
to discuss in detail, Kull.;
to expose (wares for sale), Daś.

